{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn6le18ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Christmas has always been a magical time for me. The whole family would go together to find the perfect tree. Then we'd spend the afternoon decorating it while Mom baked dozens of cookies. Dad would unwrap the ornaments and pass them out to us. We used to find a special place for each one on the tree.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le18ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "We all still have our old Christmas stockings.  We used to hang them up, then put out  milk and cookies for Santa.</br>\nIn the morning, we'd wait on the stairs while Dad turned on the tree lights. Then we'd race down to open our gifts. We'd stuff ourselves with chocolates and candy canes while we unwrapped the gifts.", "id": 2, "time": "17000", "image": "engenn6le18ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "I've got an album of Christmas photos I took. I haven't looked at it for ages! I used to write a special Christmas story every year too. Dad has collected them over the years. He's having them made into a little book for me! Christmas memories are the best!", "id": 3, "time": "35000", "image": "engenn6le18ob10re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le18ob10re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about family traditions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can discuss experiences I've had or haven't had.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about past habits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Did you used to believe in Santa Claus? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content"